:null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116560","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116560","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116560.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116560.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-14T17:11:50Z"},"body":"- Resolves https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13593\r\n- Resolves https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/64117\r\n- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106854\r\n\r\nClosely follows suggestions from the proposal. One major difference is handling the replace mode. The current implementation only has a toggle for the replace mode in the search panel as each `FindInFilesPanel` has its own replace `LineEdit`. ~Also I removed the `Replace in Files` shortcut since the mode can now be toggled quickly and it was inconsistent in being available in the script editor but not the global shortcuts. It would be possible to add a new shortcut for toggling the replace mode when the `Search Results` panel is open.~ -> Instead made the replace in files menu options/shortcuts mirror implementation of search in files\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\n\r\n- Toggling the replace mode only updates the `FindInFilesPanel` with the next search query even though a new query theoretically isn't necessary. Separating this is not so simple but should probably be done in the future. For now toggling the replace mode will start a new search to update the results `Tree` with replace features\r\n\r\n### Screenshot of latest version:\r\n\r\n<img height=\"400\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2335186-111a-4972-84a9-4b6ecc35eb90\" />","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116560/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116560/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}